From: shota <monyuonyu@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 08:19:28 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 408/417] Translations (ja): the 297 strings left of the common
 workbenches
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

TechDraw 87, Part 80, Draft 63, Sketcher 13, Spreadsheet 13, PartDesign
9, Base, Material, Robot, Gui, ReverseEngineering, Start, Test, Mesh and
Tux: all their unfinished Japanese translations, in the words already
used (追加/減算, くっつける, 表示用の線, エイリアス). BIM, CAM and FEM are
left for now.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
